  "details": "Im not sure if its just me, but one of the most annoying things in this game is the fact that whenever i try to print something out in a large group of people to show to my friends, there's always that one person who feels entitled enough to grab the print before anybody else, read it, then toss it across the map and force me to print another one. Simply make a setting that allows you to turn off the ability to grab your print for friends, non friends, or all users.",
